  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2052\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/e/e4/US_flag_56stars_Black_Stripe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150826055325\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 56stars Black Stripe.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_56stars_Black_Stripe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2048\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2048\">2048</a>&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 5, 2052</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2056\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2056\">2056</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All elligable voters who participate</small><br /><small>51% of the vote votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">57.8%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/2a/Blank_Jacobi.png/revision/latest?cb=20150811145252\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Jacobi\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/2a/Blank_Jacobi.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150811145252\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Jacobi.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Jacobi.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150810222433\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Evalyn_Jacobi\" title=\"Evalyn Jacobi\">Evalyn Jacobi</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Paul Blanco\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Progress\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Conservative\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Washington\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">New Mexico\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Dan Forest\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Pete Lowell\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">54.8%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">30.8%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"182\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Richard Sure\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Andrew Markwalter\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Green\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Libertarian\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Colorado\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Kentucky\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Jasmine Cosgrove\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Harlan Monroe\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">8.1%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">6.3%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Evalyn_Jacobi\" title=\"Evalyn Jacobi\">Evalyn Jacobi</a><br />\nConservative\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Evalyn_Jacobi\" title=\"Evalyn Jacobi\">Evalyn Jacobi</a><br />\nProgress\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The <b>2052 United States Presidential Election </b>was&#160;the 67th quadrennial presidential election, held on Tuesday November 5, 2052. Incumbent President Evalyn Jacobi, the Progressive nominee defeated Conservative Paul Blanco in the general election.\n</p><p>The election was set against the backdrop of World War III, and Jacobi won by a comfortable margin of the popular vote, partly as a result of the recent Allied victory at the Battle of Hainan.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background\">Background</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2052%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By early-2052, Japanese-led <a href=\"/wiki/Eurasian_Coalition\" title=\"Eurasian Coalition\">Coalition</a> forces had taken much of the Pacific region, while Turkish, German, and French forces were closing in on Poland. As well, the US was still in the task of rebuilding their space and air power.\n</p><p>Jacobi's prospects changed in mid to late-2052. In May of that year, US forces decisively defeated the Japanese at the Battle of Hainan and began to push into the South China Sea, while also seizing Japan's assets in Canada and the North Pacific. In space, Japanese forces were driven from <a href=\"/wiki/Luna\" title=\"Luna\">Luna</a>, and in Europe, the US and British air forces were beginning their bombing campaigns against the Turks.\n</p><p>With the tide turning in favor of the allies and the public's renewed confidence in the administration, Jacobi won a decisive victory on the first ballot, pledging to win the war for the United States.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Nominations\">Nominations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FUnited_States_presidential_election%2C_2052%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>With the outcome of the war still in doubt, some Progressive leaders opposed Jacobi's re-nomination on the grounds that she could not win. Ohio Governor Matthew Jacobs became the only candidate to contest Jacobi's re-nomination actively, but he withdrew in March when a slew of Progressive officials, including some within the state of Ohio upon whom Jacobs' campaign depended, endorsed Jacobi for re-nomination. Jacobi was still popular with most members of the Progress Party, and she received the nomination for a second term as president at the convention in Atlanta, Georgia on June 7–8, 2052.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119081903\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2701/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12894/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3693/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 10/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032030/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   61.863      1 Template:Infobox_election\n100.00%   61.863      1 -total\n 81.79%   50.600      3 Template:Infobox_election/row\n 31.22%   19.316     11 Template:Ifempty\n  9.72%    6.015      6 Template:Infobox_election/shortname\n  7.04%    4.354      1 Template:Flagicon\n  4.77%    2.948      1 Template:Country_data_United_States\n  3.39%    2.094     48 Template:!-\n  2.15%    1.328      1 Template:Flagicon/core\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1805-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119081903 and revision id 9179. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
